# zoom-trackpad-small (h2-input): ten 0.2 px steps, each too small to zoom
# alone (below the scale snap epsilon), summing to a 2 px zoom.
# Behaviour: the scale reaches 0.5*e^0.002 with no step back, url scale after
# settle. (Fractional deltas: verify Playwright's mouse.wheel carries them on
# the browser targets at run time; native queues page px directly.)
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 500
move 928 490
wheel 0 0.2
wheel 0 0.2
wheel 0 0.2
wheel 0 0.2
wheel 0 0.2
wheel 0 0.2
wheel 0 0.2
wheel 0 0.2
wheel 0 0.2
wheel 0 0.2
wait 1500
shot zoom-trackpad-small
